	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quid scribam, nescio; quemadmodum enim in iurando fecimus, ita nunc fecimus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>in foedere <placeName ref="l832">Gallicano</placeName>, si verum est, quod per viles quosdam obiter accepi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Verum, qui has reddit, melius narrabit omnia; nam antequam conclusum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>esset, querebatur apud me se timere, quod est consequutum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p3099">Sultzerus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dominica nona clamavit tam acriter contra, ut minati sint ex <placeName ref="l2448">Pagis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quidam se iure ipsum conventuros (ita <persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName>).</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName>Veltius</persName> eadem dominica contrarium <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>egit et proxima sequente adhuc vehementius et videtur vicisse.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Effecerunt illi duo, ut et nos simus in periculo, quod tamen in domino possum<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>us contemnere egregie.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Torrentem hunc sistere haud licuit nisi cum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ingenti periculo, non quidem nostro et forsitan etiam nostro, sed evangelii; coe<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>perunt enim aliqui iactare:</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Die pfaffen bringend uns, volgend wir inen, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ums evangelium in acht tagen, <foreign xml:lang="la">sic argumentantes:</foreign> Nemend wir <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>den pundt an, so werdend wir das evangeli bhalten sampt unser <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>fryheit; dann der <placeName ref="l832">Frantzos</placeName> entweders anfichtet; nemend wir inen <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>nit an, so sind wir deß keysers, der die beide anficht, unser fry<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>heit und unser grechtigkeit, von gott geben, namlich Christum Iesum etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Sic effectum, ut ego, quantum in me, tacerem una cum reliquis omnibus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Dixi quide<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>m de iure iurando et clare; dixi de foederibus in genere, ut sint licita, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>si honesta; dixi item de tyrannide regis contra pios, verum non temere.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Nihilominus non movi nisi ad tragica quędam verba, quę libebat tacendo <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>compescere, et obtinui.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Volui autem illud, ut evangelio per me suus maner<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et locus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hac de re satis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Hodie intellexi <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> circumdatos duobus episcopis et nescio quo <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>principe e civitate erupisse ac vicisse fortiter captis nobilibus usque <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>ad 26.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Nuncius est ex aula <placeName ref="l2477">Palatini</placeName>, ex <placeName ref="l452">Selestadio</placeName>, ex <placeName ref="l101">Colmaria</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Pręter hoc nihil habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in domino cum tuis omnibus ac fratribus.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>raptim 26. augusti anno 1549.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8418">Os[valdus] Myconius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>suo in domino.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
